                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Stay well clear of this terrible excuse for a game. I bought it cheap, but it is still not worth it. The gameplay was boring & janky the whole way through, & if you play it for long enough you will get to a point where the game will crash in the water temple dungeon, & you will be locked in with no way to ever escape because the developers haven't patched it out when they were working on it. It looks like the developers have known about the crash since 2018 & has still not been fixed. It has since long been abandoned.",
